{
  "name": "32 · Onboarding Buddy (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 32 · Onboarding Buddy\nNew staff joins → on **day 1, day 3 and day 7** they get a friendly WhatsApp with that day's checklist, and their manager gets a reminder. No new joiner feels lost.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Edit the 3 checklists in **Your checklists**.\n2. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Joiners**: Name, Phone, Role, Joining date (yyyy-mm-dd), Manager, Manager phone, Status (onboarding), Last sent.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format. (used when Manager phone is empty)\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nThe first message to a new number must be a template or they must message you first (WhatsApp 24-hour rule).",
        "height": 679,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "a8941e06-857a-4163-a205-e047eaa9907d",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
