              "value": "Bring Aadhaar, PAN, 2 photos and bank passbook. Meet your manager. Get your ID card and work WhatsApp group added.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "86aee0f7-ad11-4276-9263-408baf77e8fb",
              "name": "day3",
              "value": "Finish product / service training. Shadow a senior for one full shift. Ask any doubts to your manager.",
